{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52542","headline":"神湖州三山神题壁 · 陈元光","name":"神湖州三山神题壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤随不尊士，幽谷多豪杰。\n三山亦隐者，韬晦忘其名。\n胜蹟美山水，妙思神甲兵。\n精诚谅斯在，对越俨如生。\n木石森驺伏，云烟拂旆旌。\n雨阳祈响应，龙凤勅碑铭。\n清泚符神洁，香芹契德馨。\n三山耀神德，万岁翊唐灵。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}